WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
An agent proposes updating next_step on an opportunity record.

00:06.000 --> 00:13.000
The amount field is rejected — the agent grant allows only name, stage, and next_step.

00:13.000 --> 00:22.000
A human reviews the change set in the inbox and approves the allowed fields.

00:22.000 --> 00:30.000
Revision history shows the agent as the acting principal on the applied change.
